Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ぬけがけは ひどいｷｬｯﾄ｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抢先一步也太不够意思了喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}(等々力)そうですよ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)就是啊！
